# Stage3_RoadCameraFollow: the two-player cases (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (the Hatter road
# running). both: players 1 and 2 in play (+$25 bit 0 of g_Player1 and g_Player2): the camera aims
# at the mean of their x ($F67E, $F6BE). p2_only: player 1 out, player 2 in play: player 2's x.
# Real states: player 2 joins with Start in any section (scenario-two-player,
# scenario-two-player-exit), and either player can be out while the other plays on; the corpus's
# two-player runs never reach the Hatter road.

case both
b $FFFFF675 = 1
b $FFFFF6B5 = 1
l $FFFFF6BE = [$FFFFF67E] + $00400000

case p2_only
b $FFFFF675 = 0
b $FFFFF6B5 = 1
l $FFFFF6BE = [$FFFFF67E]
